&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://media.doctolib.com/image/upload/v1678356494/legal/Career-Privacy-Policy-Feb-23-EN.pdf&quot;&gt; &lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
