&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Core BI team at DoorDash builds and operates the services, integrations and automation that power business intelligence across DoorDash, Deliveroo and Wolt. Our platforms help analysts, Analytics Engineers, Data Scientists, Software Engineers and business teams discover trusted data and make informed decisions at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We combine software engineering, platform ownership, and a strong user focus to make BI tooling reliable, secure, scalable and self-service. The team supports the current BI ecosystem while helping shape a more integrated experience across the DoorDash group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer on the Core BI team, you will build and operate the backend services, APIs and infrastructure our BI platforms run on. This is a hands-on software and platform engineering role: services and integrations, identity and access automation, observability, reliability and developer experience. BI is the domain you serve (primarily Looker and Sigma, and the systems around them), but the problems are backend and platform problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own problems from discovery through design, implementation, deployment, and operational support. You will work closely with Data Engineers, Analytics Engineers, Data Scientists, Software Engineers, Product Managers and business teams to turn recurring user needs into durable, self-service capabilities. If you&#39;re energized by solving technical problems with data and comfortable being deeply embedded across several domains, this role is for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, test, deploy and operate the backend services, APIs and automation that the BI platforms across DoorDash, Deliveroo and Wolt depend on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate the platform lifecycle end to end (provisioning, metadata, permissions, migrations, archival and validation) so administration stops being manual work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the integrations between BI platforms and the wider ecosystem: warehouses, identity providers, orchestration, CI/CD and internal developer tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the availability, observability, performance, scalability and security of the systems you own, and carry them in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tooling as part of how you engineer, and where it fits, build LLM-backed capabilities held to the same reliability and governance bar as anything else we ship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the engineering bar on the team, from service design and code review to testing, CI/CD and documentation, and improve the developer experience for everyone building on the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional software engineering experience building and operating production backend, platform or infrastructure systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Readable, maintainable, well-tested code in Python, plus comfort with SQL and a working understanding of data modelling and warehousing concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and owning APIs, integrations or automation in production, with sound judgement on service boundaries, authentication, data contracts and failure modes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with CI/CD, containers and Kubernetes, observability, debugging and incident response, and you expect to operate what you build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using AI tools (LLMs, agentic workflows, AI-assisted development) as part of how you engineer, and judgement about where they help and where they do not&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end ownership of ambiguous problems, clear communication with technical and non-technical teams, and comfort self-organising in a fast-paced, distributed environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning or integrating with BI platforms such as Looker, Sigma or comparable tools, and familiarity with semantic layers such as LookML or dbt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience automating identity and access through Okta, SCIM or role-based access controls, or building multi-tenant platforms across brands and regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shipping LLM-backed features to real users (retrieval, grounding and evaluation), or with MCP, agent frameworks or tool-calling in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Figma is growing our team of passionate creatives and builders on a mission to make design accessible to all. Figma’s platform helps teams bring ideas to life—whether you&#39;re brainstorming, creating a prototype, translating designs into code, or iterating with AI. From idea to product, Figma empowers teams to streamline workflows, move faster, and work together in real time from anywhere in the world. If you&#39;re excited to shape the future of design and collaboration, join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Figma is growing our team of passionate people on a mission to make design accessible to all.&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/blog/meet-us-in-the-browser/&quot;&gt; Born on the Web&lt;/a&gt;, Figma helps entire product teams&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/blog/introducing-figjam/&quot;&gt; brainstorm&lt;/a&gt;, create, test, and ship better designs, together. From great products to long-lasting companies, we believe that nothing great is made alone - come&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/blog/inside-maker-week-more-than-a-hackathon/&quot;&gt; make&lt;/a&gt; with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Figma is looking for a Director, SMB Sales (EMEA) to join our growing Global Commercial organization. As Director of SMB Sales, EMEA, you&#39;ll lead a team of frontline managers and Account Executives responsible for helping growing businesses adopt Figma&#39;s Organization and Enterprise plans. Reporting to the VP of Commercial Sales, you&#39;ll play a critical role in scaling a high-volume, specialized sales motion while partnering closely with leaders across the Americas and JAPAC to drive consistency, share best practices, and evolve how we serve SMB customers globally. This is an opportunity to shape the next chapter of one of Figma&#39;s fastest-growing businesses, leading a talented team while influencing strategy across Sales, Marketing, Operations, Enablement, and Product. At Figma, we value leaders who think creatively, challenge the status quo, and build teams that consistently raise the bar for customer experience and business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full time role that can be held from one of our EMEA hubs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop, and inspire a team of frontline managers and Account Executives, building a high-performing culture focused on coaching, accountability, and customer impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale the EMEA SMB business by driving operational excellence across forecasting, pipeline management, inspection, and execution against revenue goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with SMB leaders across the Americas and JAPAC to build a globally consistent sales motion, sharing best practices and raising execution standards across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, hire, and develop exceptional sales leaders while building a strong internal pipeline of future Mid-Market leaders and second-line managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach managers through forecast reviews, pipeline inspections, deal strategy, call coaching, and performance management to improve both team execution and customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to identify opportunities, test new strategies, and continuously improve the SMB sales motion, including territory design, pipeline generation, productivity, and conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Operations, Enablement, Marketing, Solutions Consulting, Customer Experience, and Product to influence the evolution of the SMB business and improve how we serve customers globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an executive sponsor for strategic customer opportunities while representing the voice of EMEA in the continued evolution of Figma&#39;s global SMB strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience leading SaaS sales organizations, including at least 4 years in sales management. You’ve managed frontline leaders and spent at least 2 years in a second-line leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve led distributed sales teams across multiple countries and understand the differences between EMEA markets. Comfortable balancing long-term strategy with the realities of day-to-day execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built and scaled teams of Sales Managers and Account Executives in a high-growth company. Ideally, you also have experience with SMB or Commercial SaaS sales, particularly in a product-led growth business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know how to coach leaders, develop talent, and create inclusive teams that perform consistently. You’ve exceeded revenue targets while improving forecasting and building dependable sales processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident using data to make decisions and have worked closely with Marketing, Operations, Enablement, Product, and other go-to-market teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;While it’s not required, it’s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using or working with Figma, or other UX/UI experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional European language fluency (e.g. French, German, Spanish)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Command of the Message or MEDDIC/MEDDICC sales methodology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background scaling teams across multiple EMEA markets simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Figma, one of our values is Grow as you go. We believe in hiring smart, curious people who are excited to learn and develop their skills. If you’re excited about this role but your past experience doesn’t align perfectly with the points outlined in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Figma we celebrate and support our differences. We know employing a team rich in diverse thoughts, experiences, and opinions allows our employees, our product and our community to flourish. Figma is an &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2022-10/EEOC_KnowYourRights_screen_reader_10_20.pdf&quot;&gt;equal opportunity workplace&lt;/a&gt; - we are dedicated to equal employment opportunities regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity/expression, veteran status&lt;strong&gt;, &lt;/strong&gt;or any other characteristic protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will work to ensure individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to apply for a role, participate in the interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive other benefits and privileges of employment. If you require accommodation, please reach out to &lt;a ---------- These modifications enable an individual with a disability to have an equal opportunity not only to get a job, but successfully perform their job tasks to the same extent as people without disabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Examples of accommodations include but are not limited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holding interviews in an accessible location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling closed captioning on video conferencing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all written communication be compatible with screen readers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the mode or format of interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure the integrity of our hiring process and facilitate a more personal connection, we require all candidates keep their cameras on during video interviews. Additionally, if hired you will be required to attend in person onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, the candidate acknowledges and agrees that any personal data contained in their application or supporting materials will be processed in accordance with &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Figma&#39;s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As Staff Engineer, you&#39;ll own the architecture, agents and skills that let every builder in your tribe ship sound, well-architected work without waiting on a handoff, at a moment when Mews has moved almost entirely to an agentic-first engineering model. The problem this role exists to solve is easy to state and hard to do: most technical decisions now get made by builders and the agents they run, not by senior engineers in review, so the standard has to be built into the tooling itself or the gaps show up in what customers touch. Mews is rebuilding hospitality software from the ground up at a genuinely unusual pace, which makes this one of the few staff engineering roles where the leverage you build gets used by everyone around you within weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be attached to one tribe, reporting into its Director, and working alongside other staff engineers, staff product managers and staff designers across your division. Your job isn&#39;t to ship features. It&#39;s to produce the architecture, agents and skills that give every builder in the tribe the context to make sound calls on their own, and to stay hands-on with the hardest problems yourself: the gnarly migrations and system-wide refactors that need an approach invented rather than executed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Mews moves builders to own a sub-metric end-to-end, with AI covering what they&#39;re lighter in, the risk isn&#39;t slower shipping, it&#39;s the architecture fragmenting underneath the speed. This role exists so the foundations get stronger as the tribe ships faster, not shakier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you would do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the tribe&#39;s engineering context, agents and skills, and be accountable for keeping them coherent, current and grounded in real product work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and evaluate the internal engineering agents and skills that Product Builders use daily, encoding architectural standards, review logic and quality gates directly into the tools they run&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend and improve the tribe&#39;s agentic tooling when it isn&#39;t good enough yet, since agentic development is the default way you build, not a fallback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay hands-on with the hardest technical problems: gnarly migrations, system-wide refactors and architecture calls that will shape years of future building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;When work ships off-bar, trace it back to what was missing in the agents or patterns and fix it at the root so the same class of miss doesn&#39;t recur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency Level 4:&lt;/strong&gt; in this role that means building and shipping the engineering agents and skills that Product Builders rely on every day, not just using AI tools yourself. You need enough understanding of the underlying models and infrastructure to make real engineering decisions about them, because the agents you build become part of the tribe&#39;s production system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For more information on AI fluency at Mews, please refer to &quot;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mews.atlassian.net/wiki/external/YWI5ZGUyMGQ3MjU2NGRmNjlkZGEyYTg2NTVmZGE0OTU&quot;&gt;AI Fluency at Mews: A Comprehensive Guide for Candidates&lt;/a&gt;&quot; on Confluence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you would bring&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record as a senior or staff-level engineer who has shipped and owned complex systems at scale, not just contributed to them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience turning hard-won technical judgment into reusable architecture, tooling or standards that other engineers actually adopt, rather than documentation that goes unused&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort holding a multi-cycle technical view (migrations, refactors, architecture decisions that play out over years) while still being able to drop into what needs to ship today&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication across levels: builders, your Director, Principals and, when it counts, the C-suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Fluency Level 4 or the equivalent hands-on experience: you&#39;ve shipped something where AI is a core component and can make engineering decisions about the underlying models and infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in hospitality, travel or another operationally complex B2B SaaS environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of coaching or multiplying other engineers&#39; output, not just your own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public writing or speaking about technical work you&#39;ve shipped&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Spain&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€79.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€100.500 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Czechia&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 491 000 Kč&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2 005 000 Kč CZK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£81,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£106,500 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Ireland&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€91.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€107.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Jamf, we believe in an open, flexible culture based on respect and trust. Our track record and thriving work environment all stem from the freedom we grant ourselves to get the job done right. We take pride in helping tens of thousands of customers around the globe succeed with Apple.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The secret to our success lies in our connectivity, while operating with a high degree of flexibility. Work-life balance remains our priority while feeling connected is important to maintain our strong culture, achieve our goals, and thrive as #OneJamf.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do at Jamf:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Inside Enterprise Account Executive role is an evangelist and subject matter expert, responsible for expanding sales within the Enterprise UK&amp;amp;I territory by selling the Whole Product Experience (WPE) and building out Jamf’s Apple Enterprise Management and Security footprint in the FRANCE Enterprise market (&amp;gt;1000 employees). The Inside Enterprise Account Executive is part of the Enterprise team and is responsible for the growth of recurring revenue (ARR) by retaining and growing both new and existing customers. It is responsible for driving thought leadership within the respective verticals, at multiple levels into accounts, concentrating on adoption strategies for implementing the WPE and will assist in formulating and guiding business validation cases in order to expedite adoption. The Inside Enterprise Account Executive will work closely with our partners and channel ecosystem to nurture and fulfil new business opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is offered in France, preferrabily for candidates located and used to travel witin the Paris area #LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you can expect to do this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow existing and new customer relationships and elevate Jamf to a more strategic position within Enterprise accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate sales of Jamf’s Product Portfolio by helping organizations succeed with Apple within a list of key accounts in FRANCE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute on a long-term building pipeline strategy, while closing in quarter opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ascertain Apple’s assigned accounts adoption, growth strategies, and business plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prescribe short-term and long-term solutions to achieve customer and client goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and support in complex enterprise sales campaigns while managing a diverse set of stakeholders, partners, and Apple team members within the same account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure and negotiate sales &amp;amp; legal agreements with clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Apple and channel partners to develop and execute strategies toward generating opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize internal and competitive data to benchmark sales performance and determine strategic implications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creates an environment where all job responsibilities are in alignment with the core values, mission and purpose of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fosters a workplace with the highest moral, ethical and legal standards to deliver an environment that promotes respect, innovation and creativity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Models a positive, inclusive workplace one in which the talents and strengths of our increasingly diverse workforce are welcomed, further developed and manifested in our work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional working proficiency in French and English (required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of selling experience in related (IT/Software/SaaS) technology industry with demonstrated quota achievement. (required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ Years’ experience in selling into Large Corporate, Enterprise accounts and/or FTSE accounts with demonstrated achievement (required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the endpoint technology IT industry and familiarity with the Apple platform (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record collaborating with channel reseller and/or direct touch customers with demonstrated target achievement (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to accurately forecast business weekly, on a monthly and quarterly basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work effectively across all levels of business and IT contacts within large and complex organizations, including legal, procurement and executive teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of coordination within an internal set of multi-functional teams to ensure target quotas are achieved and exceeded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and customer service skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and collaborate and coordinate with other team members, especially in the Enterprise teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one year of experience working in the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10% travelling expected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY AND PRIVACY REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in ongoing security training is mandatory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established security protocols will be adhered to, sensitive data will be handled responsibly, and data protection practices are followed, including understanding relevant privacy regulations and reporting breaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acknowledging the Jamf Code of Conduct, where applicable security and privacy policies can be found, is a requirement of all roles at Jamf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Why Jamf?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Named a Fortune Best Workplace for Millennials, 2021.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We offer a clear and defined sales career path. Our main goal is to help you successfully step into our Account Executive role, but there are many ways to advance your career at Jamf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We train and then we give you the room to grow. Our Jamfs can explore the vertical career path, as well as the horizontal, to discover new interests and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You don’t have to be a techie to be a Jamf. Our best-in-class sales focused Bootcamp training provides you with the technical and product knowledge required to confidently talk with customers about Jamf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We set achievable targets, help each other out, and share best practices across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You will have the opportunity to make a real and meaningful impact for more than 70,000 global customers with the best Apple device management solution in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We put people over profits – which is why our customers keep coming back to us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We encourage you to simply be you. We constantly seek and value different perspectives to ensure Jamf is a place where everyone feels comfortable and can be successful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;23 of 25 world’s most valuable brands rely on Jamf to do their best work (as ranked by Forbes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What it means to be a Jamf?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are a team of free-thinkers, can-doers, and problem-crushers. We value humility and the relentless pursuit of knowledge. Our culture flows from a spirit of selflessness and relentless self-improvement - driving both personal growth and collective progress throughout our company. We unite around common goals while respecting personal approaches, believing that fulfilled individuals create a thriving, vibrant workplace.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our aim is simple: hire exceptionally good people who are incredibly good at what they do and let them do it. We provide the support and resources to let everyone be their authentic, best selves at work, at rest, and at play. We are committed to supporting the continual improvement of Apple in the workplace, the organizations that rely on them and the people who keep it all running smoothly.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above it all, waves our banner of #OneJamf – and the knowledge that when we stand together, we accomplish so much more than we could alone. We seek individuals who share this unwavering journey toward growth to join us in our quest for constant improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does Jamf do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Jamf extends the legendary Apple experience people enjoy in their personal lives to the workplace. We believe the experience of using a device at work or school should feel the same, and be as secure as, using a personal device.&amp;nbsp;With Jamf, customers are able to confidently automate Mac, iPad, iPhone and Apple TV deployment, management, and security – anytime, anywhere – to protect the data and applications used by employees in the workplace, students learning in the classroom, and streamline communications in healthcare between patients and providers.&amp;nbsp;More than 2,500 Jamf strong worldwide, we are free-thinkers, can-doers, and problems crushers who are encouraged to bring their whole selves to work each and every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get social with us and follow the conversation at #OneJamf&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Jamf is committed to creating an inclusive &amp;amp; supportive work environment for all candidates and employees. Candidates with disabilities or religious beliefs are encouraged to reach out if they need additional support or alternative options to our recruiting processes to accommodate their disability or religious belief. If you need an accommodation, please contact your Recruiter or Recruiting Coordinator directly. Requests for accommodation will be handled confidentially by Recruiting and will not be shared with the hiring manager. Jamf is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate against individuals who request reasonable accommodation for disability or religious beliefs. To request accommodations please email us at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;En bref&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Picnic, nous réinventons la façon dont les familles font leurs courses, grâce à un service innovant et durable disponible via une application. L’une des fonctionnalités préférées de nos clients est notre collection de recettes, qui nous permettent de proposer à nos clients des idées de repas savoureux et sains à préparer avec nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aujourd’hui, nous recherchons deux profils étudiants à mi-temps pour venir renforcer l’équipe, et nous aider &lt;strong&gt;sur la traduction et le suivi qualité de nos délicieuses recettes&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Que tu suives des études en business, marketing, nutrition, ou que tu sois simplement passionné·e par la cuisine, c’est une excellente opportunité pour découvrir les coulisses d’une startup en pleine croissance dans la foodtech. Ce que nous recherchons avant tout : une personne débrouillarde, avec un fort sens business, passionnée de cuisine et motivée pour apprendre !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le poste est à pourvoir au sein de l’équipe Meals à partir de&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;septembre, à raison de 16 heures par semaine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrichissement du catalogue: Tu contribues à élargir notre offre de recettes en traduisant celles proposées par notre équipe internationale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amélioration de nos recettes: Tu identifies les erreurs qui se cachent dans nos recettes et tu mets en place les améliorations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement de nos processus: À partir des erreurs identifiées, tu proposes des améliorations de nos processus de création ou de management de nos recettes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintien de la qualité de nos bases de données: nos recettes se basent sur des bases de données relationnelles. Améliorer une base de données bénéficie à toutes les recettes !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos de toi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es actuellement en formation dans un domaine lié au commerce, marketing ou équivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu adores cuisiner pour toi ou tes proches, et tester les nouvelles tendances culinaires&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es autonome, curieux·se et aimes apprendre sur le terrain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu aimes mettre en valeur tes créations et accordes une grande attention aux détails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu maîtrises parfaitement le français et l’anglais à l’écrit comme à l’oral, pour échanger facilement avec tes collègues internationaux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Avantages Picnic&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🍴 Restauration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comme nous sommes implantés au centre de Paris, pas de cantine sur place. Par contre, des tickets restaurant d’une valeur de 11€ par jour sont remis afin de tester tous les délicieux restaurants du coin. Notre petite cuisine est également équipée de savoureux en-cas et rafraîchissements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚲 Santé et transports&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grâce à nos partenariats avec Sidecare et OpenUp, tu as la possibilité de souscrire à notre mutuelle d’entreprise ainsi qu’à un accès facile et gratuit à des psychologues professionnels, des ateliers et des outils pratiques. De plus, si tu te rends au travail en transports en commun, nous te remboursons ton abonnement à hauteur de 50%.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍️ Développement personnel et professionnel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
